{"parse":{"title":"Poison Resistance Mead","pageid":816,"revid":47695,"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"infobox-tabber\"><div class=\"tabber wds-tabber\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper with-bottom-border\"><ul class=\"wds-tabs\"><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\" data-hash=\"Mead\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Mead</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Mead_base\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Mead base</a></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Poison resistance mead</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/7/7c/Poison_Resistance_Mead.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215131806\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Poison resistance mead\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/7/7c/Poison_Resistance_Mead.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215131806\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/7/7c/Poison_Resistance_Mead.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215131806 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/7/7c/Poison_Resistance_Mead.png/revision/latest?cb=20210215131806 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Poison resistance mead\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" data-image-key=\"Poison_resistance_mead.png\" data-image-name=\"Poison resistance mead.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><i>Fortifies you against poison. You take less damage from poison.</i></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Mead</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"id\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Internal ID</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">MeadPoisonResist</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"source\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fermenter\" title=\"Fermenter\">Fermenter</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usage\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usage</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Drinking</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Properties</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\">Weight</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"stack\">Stack</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\">1.0</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"stack\">10</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"teleport\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle toccolours\" style=\"float: none;\"><span title=\"Can go through wood portal?\" style=\"cursor:pointer\"><span style=\"cursor: help; border-bottom:2px dotted var(--theme-accent-color)\">Teleportable</span></span></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"> (Can go through wood portal?)</div></div></h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Yes</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Crafting Materials</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Crafts 6</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Mead_base:_Poison_resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mead base: Poison resistance\">Mead base: Poison resistance</a> x1</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Effects</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"duration\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Duration</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span style=\"cursor: help; border-bottom: 2px dotted var(--theme-accent-color);\" title=\"600s\">10m</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cooldown\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Cooldown</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span style=\"cursor: help; border-bottom: 2px dotted var(--theme-accent-color);\" title=\"600s\">10m</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"effect\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Other Effect(s)</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Very resistant vs. Poison</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Mead base: Poison resistance</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/8/8c/Mead_Base_-_Poison_Resistance.png/revision/latest?cb=20241108233954\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Mead base: Poison resistance\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/8/8c/Mead_Base_-_Poison_Resistance.png/revision/latest?cb=20241108233954\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/8/8c/Mead_Base_-_Poison_Resistance.png/revision/latest?cb=20241108233954 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/8/8c/Mead_Base_-_Poison_Resistance.png/revision/latest?cb=20241108233954 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Mead base: Poison resistance\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" data-image-key=\"Mead_base%3A_Poison_resistance.png\" data-image-name=\"Mead base: Poison resistance.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><i>Needs to be fermented.</i></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Mead Base</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"id\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Internal ID</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">MeadBasePoisonResist</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"source\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mead_ketill\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mead ketill\">Mead ketill</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usage\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usage</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fermenter\" title=\"Fermenter\">Fermenter</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Properties</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\">Weight</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"stack\">Stack</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\">1.0</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"stack\">1</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"teleport\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle toccolours\" style=\"float: none;\"><span title=\"Can go through wood portal?\" style=\"cursor:pointer\"><span style=\"cursor: help; border-bottom:2px dotted var(--theme-accent-color)\">Teleportable</span></span></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"> (Can go through wood portal?)</div></div></h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Yes</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Crafting Materials</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Honey\" title=\"Honey\">Honey</a> x10</li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Thistle\" title=\"Thistle\">Thistle</a> x5</li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Neck_tail\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Neck tail\">Neck tail</a> x1</li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Coal\" title=\"Coal\">Coal</a> x10</li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div></div></div>\n<p><b>Poison resistance mead</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Forest\" title=\"Black Forest\">Black Forest</a>-tier consumable item <a href=\"/wiki/Fermenter\" title=\"Fermenter\">fermented</a> from <b>Mead base: Poison resistance</b>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Recipe\">Recipe</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPoison_Resistance_Mead%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>Mead base: Poison resistance</i> is produced in a <a href=\"/wiki/Mead_ketill\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mead ketill\">Mead ketill</a> with:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Honey\" title=\"Honey\"><img alt=\"Honey\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/c/c6/Honey.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20210215131700\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Honey.png\" data-image-key=\"Honey.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>&#160;10&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Honey\" title=\"Honey\">Honey</a></li>\n<li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thistle\" title=\"Thistle\"><img alt=\"Thistle\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/1/1a/Thistle.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20210213200417\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Thistle.png\" data-image-key=\"Thistle.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>&#160;5&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Thistle\" title=\"Thistle\">Thistle</a></li>\n<li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Neck_tail\" title=\"Neck tail\"><img alt=\"Neck Tail\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/3/37/Neck_Tail.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20210215131742\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Neck Tail.png\" data-image-key=\"Neck_Tail.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>&#160;1&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Neck_tail\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Neck tail\">Neck tail</a></li>\n<li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Coal\" title=\"Coal\"><img alt=\"Coal\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Coal.png\" data-image-key=\"Coal.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/a/a7/Coal.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20210210054455\" /></a></span>&#160;10&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Coal\" title=\"Coal\">Coal</a></li></ul>\n<p>Six <i>Poison resistance meads</i> are produced by <a href=\"/wiki/Fermenter\" title=\"Fermenter\">fermenting</a> the mead base for two in-game <a href=\"/wiki/Day_and_Night_Cycle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Day and Night Cycle\">days</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\">Effect</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPoison_Resistance_Mead%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Upon consumption, it grants \"very resistant\" to <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_types#Poison\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage types\">poison damage</a> for 10 minutes, reducing <a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\">poison effect</a> duration and tick damage by 75%.\n</p><p>The poison resistance only works on poison applied while the resistance is active. A player drinking the mead after they were poisoned will not reduce the effect duration or tick damage.\n</p><p>You typically want to save this for directly before entering combat with a poisonous enemy to get the most time out of the potion. This potion does not last very long so you may want to bring a few per trip.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fvalheim.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FPoison_Resistance_Mead%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>It is recommended to craft some before entering the <a href=\"/wiki/Swamp\" title=\"Swamp\">Swamp</a> for the first time to counteract the <a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\">poison</a> effect\n<ul><li>Other poison-resistant gear requires <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Root_(item)\" title=\"Root (item)\"><img alt=\"Root\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Root.png\" data-image-key=\"Root.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/valheim/images/8/80/Root.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20211208154320\" /></a></span>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Root_(item)\" title=\"Root (item)\">Roots</a>, which are only obtainable by killing <a href=\"/wiki/Abomination\" title=\"Abomination\">Abominations</a>.</li></ul></li>\n<li>The Poison resistance mead's \"very resistant\" effect overrides the \"resistant\" effect of the <a href=\"/wiki/Root_mask\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Root mask\">Root mask</a>.</li>\n<li>While the Poison resistance mead has a stronger effect than the <a href=\"/wiki/Root_Set\" title=\"Root Set\">Root Mask</a>, The <a href=\"/wiki/Root_Set\" title=\"Root Set\">Root Mask's</a> buff never expires.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"Show\" data-collapsetext=\"Hide\"><tbody><tr class=\"navbox-title\"><th colspan=\"2\" scope=\"col\"><span class=\"navbox-vde\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:FoodsNav\" title=\"Template:FoodsNav\"><span title=\"View this navbox template\">v</span></a> · <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\